 custom jump scare if you di","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T00:13:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165574828","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4816410-1836506165560980","game_id":"steam-4816410","kind":"update","title":"Patch notes for 1.2.6 FOR DEMO on Steam","summary":"Patch notes for 1.2.6 FOR DEMO on Steam-Added a Battery system for the flashlight and also Added Battery Dispencers throughout the UT Facility for players to refill the batts on there flashlights-Added and Confirmed Resolution fixes for the loading screen and should work via Steam Deck expanding support through steams re-mapping feature, also in settings, it is explained if playing through steam and using any other controllers to remap the controls from an Xbox controller.-Resolutions should set","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T20:58:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165560980","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4816410-1835871199308659","game_id":"steam-4816410","kind":"update","title":"Patch notes for 1.2.5 For Demo Build","summary":"-Fixed where Objectives were a bit to obscure and not defined in the demos map for EIS, Fixed the Objectives in the corner to be more defined and guide the player with more definition on what they need to do for the map they are in for whatever ending they are going to achive.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-20T03:29:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199308659","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","conten